    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based strategy game where, in a world constantly invaded by the Demon Lord, you use your wisdom to compete for fame with other players and become a legendary guild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/cc5fb77c0c53bdff75392165009f594a.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/d4dc7516ba54823d9869a2e5ea77c3ea.poster.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/d4dc7516ba54823d9869a2e5ea77c3ea.webm?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/d4dc7516ba54823d9869a2e5ea77c3ea.mp4?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demon Lord has a chance to invade towns every day, turning them into monster nests. This will be a challenge in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each month, all buildings on the map will randomly change. Can you make the wisest decisions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/0abc00b0882e8cf8a502cdc8bf21f822.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/c4b7e73338299601079f9cae7824c926.poster.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/c4b7e73338299601079f9cae7824c926.webm?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/c4b7e73338299601079f9cae7824c926.mp4?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Management, alchemy, combat training \u2013 freely combine them. How will you defeat your opponents?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/49ffef08c786a98533ed416e91096479.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/b4a137a106bfc93c7f47fb19903a8728.poster.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/b4a137a106bfc93c7f47fb19903a8728.webm?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/b4a137a106bfc93c7f47fb19903a8728.mp4?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/b7b6be5492c4802e32ab9e94f9344a7e.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/b228861044b9b8094e6286c5882a96ff.poster.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/b228861044b9b8094e6286c5882a96ff.webm?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/b228861044b9b8094e6286c5882a96ff.mp4?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasures with diverse effects, how do you choose the best ones?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/2418b3d828c05b39873824c234a5ea6e.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/98ad83ecfb995e6f57b4a9d2b29f21da.poster.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/98ad83ecfb995e6f57b4a9d2b29f21da.webm?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/98ad83ecfb995e6f57b4a9d2b29f21da.mp4?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse alchemy options, where risks and rewards coexist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Properties\uff08Mischief and Profit Go Hand in Hand\uff09</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versatile commercial buildings, how should you construct them to assist you and trap your opponents in the mud?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Badges (Boost Your Team's Strength!)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What badges await you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And much more...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waiting for you to discover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based strategy game where, in a world constantly invaded by the Demon Lord, you use your wisdom to compete for fame with other players and become a legendary guild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/cc5fb77c0c53bdff75392165009f594a.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/d4dc7516ba54823d9869a2e5ea77c3ea.poster.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/d4dc7516ba54823d9869a2e5ea77c3ea.webm?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/d4dc7516ba54823d9869a2e5ea77c3ea.mp4?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demon Lord has a chance to invade towns every day, turning them into monster nests. This will be a challenge in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each month, all buildings on the map will randomly change. Can you make the wisest decisions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/0abc00b0882e8cf8a502cdc8bf21f822.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/c4b7e73338299601079f9cae7824c926.poster.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/c4b7e73338299601079f9cae7824c926.webm?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/c4b7e73338299601079f9cae7824c926.mp4?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Management, alchemy, combat training \u2013 freely combine them. How will you defeat your opponents?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/49ffef08c786a98533ed416e91096479.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/b4a137a106bfc93c7f47fb19903a8728.poster.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/b4a137a106bfc93c7f47fb19903a8728.webm?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/b4a137a106bfc93c7f47fb19903a8728.mp4?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/b7b6be5492c4802e32ab9e94f9344a7e.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/b228861044b9b8094e6286c5882a96ff.poster.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/b228861044b9b8094e6286c5882a96ff.webm?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/b228861044b9b8094e6286c5882a96ff.mp4?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasures with diverse effects, how do you choose the best ones?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/2418b3d828c05b39873824c234a5ea6e.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/98ad83ecfb995e6f57b4a9d2b29f21da.poster.avif?t=1750138404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/98ad83ecfb995e6f57b4a9d2b29f21da.webm?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646920/extras/98ad83ecfb995e6f57b4a9d2b29f21da.mp4?t=1750138404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse alchemy options, where risks and rewards coexist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Properties\uff08Mischief and Profit Go Hand in Hand\uff09</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versatile commercial buildings, how should you construct them to assist you and trap your opponents in the mud?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Badges (Boost Your Team's Strength!)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What badges await you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And much more...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waiting for you to discover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
